<h1
  style='font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3A5A40; margin: 0 0 8px 0;'
>
  You're almost there, {{userName}}
</h1>
<p style='color: #666; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 24px 0;'>
  Finish setting up your Spiriment account — it only takes a few minutes.
</p>

<p>
  Thanks for joining Spiriment. We noticed you started signing up but haven't
  finished your profile yet.
</p>

{{#if hasRole}}
  <div class='info-box'>
    You're signed up as a <strong>{{role}}</strong>. Complete the remaining
    steps so we can match you and unlock the full experience.
  </div>
{{else}}
  <div class='info-box'>
    Choose whether you're joining as a <strong>mentee</strong> or
    <strong>mentor</strong>, then finish a short setup.
  </div>
{{/if}}

<p style='font-weight: 600; color: #3A5A40; margin: 28px 0 12px 0;'>
  Once you're set up, you can:
</p>
<ul style='padding-left: 20px; color: #333; font-size: 15px;'>
  <li style='margin-bottom: 8px;'>Connect with mentors or mentees</li>
  <li style='margin-bottom: 8px;'>Build a Bible reading habit</li>
  <li style='margin-bottom: 8px;'>Grow in faith with guided sessions</li>
</ul>

<div style='text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0;'>
  <a
    href='{{appLink}}'
    style='background-color: #3A5A40; color: #fff; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; font-size: 15px;'
  >
    Continue setup
  </a>
</div>

<p style='font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin-top: 24px;'>
  With blessings,<br />
  <strong>The Spiriment Team</strong>
</p>
